      "oep-ke-keph-pharmacy-061-option-2": "Antibiotics are ineffective against viral infections and should not be used for them.",
      "oep-ke-keph-pharmacy-061-option-3": "Oral therapy is preferred where appropriate; routine IV use is not a stewardship principle."
