    "explanation": "Using C1V1 = C2V2: (20%)(V1) = (5%)(200 mL), so V1 = (5 x 200)/20 = 50 mL of stock, then make up to 200 mL with diluent. This dilution principle applies to all stock-to-final preparations.",
