    "answer": "oep-ke-keph-pharmacy-037-option-1",
    "explanation": "Modified or sustained release formulations release the active ingredient gradually to maintain steady plasma concentrations and reduce dosing frequency. Such tablets must usually be swallowed whole, because crushing can cause dose dumping.",
